      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺も楽しかったよ。\n忙しくて、なかなかお店を開けられなかったもんね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 8
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ。しばらくすれば、我々Cafe Paradeが\n出演する映画が公開されます。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "宣伝や取材の仕事もこれから増えて行くでしょうし、\nもっと忙しくなりますよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 12
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ。\nそれにしても公開まであと少しか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 13
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この間クランクアップしたばかりだと思ったのに、\n時間が過ぎるのは早いね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 14
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "撮影、大変だったけど楽しかったよね～。\n早く映画館で見たいな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 17
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うむ。我ら同胞団の姿を封じし幻影……\n早く光の民にも見てもらいたいものだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アスラン=BBⅡ世"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "029ass"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "029ass",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 18
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「出でよキャンディーポップモンスター！　この街の\nパティシエをすべて飲み込んでしまうがいい！」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アスラン=BBⅡ世"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "029ass"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "029ass",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 22
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はは、アスランはハマり役だったな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "027yuk",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 26
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ。それに、ケーキへの愛に溢れた作品でした。\nワンカットのために本物を用意していましたしね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "028soi",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 27
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "撮影後に振舞われたケーキ、全部最高でした！\n特にクライマックスに出てくるケーキ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 30
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_3_30013_01_b:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_3_30013_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい。繊細で素晴らしい逸品でしたね。どんな技法が\n使われているか、今度ゆっくり研究したいものです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "performance": {
